+### Task 5: Make live-event costs dimensional and source-aware
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `dashboard/js/live-event-diff.js:1-45`
+- Modify: `dashboard/js/live-event-feed.js:1-55`
+- Modify: `dashboard/js/api.js:1-200`
